<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2013/Faraway-Farm-2.jpg" alt="A plein air painting showing part of a stone farm house" width="500" height="717" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Faraway Farm 2. Oil on linen, approx. 5" X 8". 2013.</p>
<p>As you may know, I'm a member of Loudoun Sketch Club. &nbsp;This plein air painting group visits some of the best farms, estates and other scenic places in the area, most of which are privately owned and I wouldn't otherwise be able to paint.</p>
<p>This is a one hour sketch from Faraway Farm in Bluemont, a continuation of my theme of keeping the plein air work to smaller paintings, sketches and studies.&nbsp;</p>